# Teleparty - Watch Together on Netflix, YouTube, HBO Max + more

## About Teleparty
Teleparty (formerly Netflix Party) is a browser extension and web service that allows friends to watch TV shows and movies together online. Users can synchronize video playback, chat in real-time, and share reactions while watching content on popular streaming platforms.

## Supported Platforms
- Netflix
- YouTube
- Disney+
- Hulu
- HBO Max
- Amazon Prime Video
- Crunchyroll
- And many more streaming services

## Key Features
- Synchronized video playback across all participants
- Real-time chat during watching sessions
- Voice and video chat capabilities
- Mobile support for iOS and Android
- Premium features for enhanced experience

## How It Works
1. Install the Teleparty browser extension
2. Start watching on any supported streaming platform
3. Share the party link with friends
4. Everyone's video syncs automatically
5. Chat and react together in real-time

## Use Cases
- Long-distance movie nights with friends
- Family gatherings across different locations
- Watch parties for new show releases
- Group reactions to favorite content
- Educational content viewing with classmates
- Corporate team building through shared entertainment

